  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The proposal due to its height, width and bulk of the proposed extension would result in an unsympathetic dominant addition to the rear elevation of the dwelling which would not be a subservient addition to the dwelling and is not considered to be of high quality design. The proposal would harm the character and appearance of the rear elevation of the dwelling visible from public views. The proposal would therefore fail to comply with Policy LP1 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 Strategic Planning (2020), Policies D4 of the London Plan 2021, Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (2025) and the NPPF.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The proposal due to its height, depth and proximity to neighbouring property windows and amenity space, would result in an unacceptable perception of enclosure and an overbearing impact, loss of daylight / sunlight and overshadowing. The proposed development would have an unacceptable impact on the residential amenity of neighbouring occupiers and would fail to comply with LP33 policy LP2 and the REA SPD (2025).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
